-- Compare reactors with [reducers](/chronicle/reducers/) and [projections](/chronicle/projections/)
-- Use [tagging reactors](/chronicle/concepts/tagging-reactors/) when you need to organize observer behavior
+Read [Event Processing](event-processing) when your handler needs context or dependencies, or [Filtering](filtering) when only some events of a handled type should reach it. [Tagging reactors](/chronicle/concepts/tagging-reactors/) labels observers for organization; it does not filter delivery.
+
+For the data-building alternative, compare [reducers](/chronicle/reducers/) and [projections](/chronicle/projections/).
